CM_ "2023 Toyota Corolla (TSS 3.0) powertrain -- CAN FD + SecOC.";
CM_ "STATUS: every bit position below is DECODED FROM PASSIVE RLOGS, NOT CONFIRMED.";
CM_ "Validate in cabana against a real rlog before trusting any value. See NOTES.md.";
CM_ "Bit convention: big-endian (@0) value at byte K -> startbit = K*8 + 7.";
CM_ "SECOC_SYNCHRONIZATION copied verbatim from opendbc toyota_secoc_pt.dbc -- do not hand-edit.";
CM_ "DBC name MUST keep the toyota_ prefix: opendbc auto-computes the CHECKSUM signal off it.";


